message: "If you refer to this article or reuse its material, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "One Wire, Many MCUs, No Lost Messages: Baton-C as a Zephyr Module"
abstract: >-
  Article and reproducible evidence: Baton-C, a deterministic single-wire UART bus
  in MISRA C, integrated into Zephyr RTOS as a module, tested as a three-node bus
  with line noise on native_sim, and brought up on a Microchip SmartFusion2 board.
